---
import SingOzCard from '@/components/blocks/SingOzCard.astro';
import Section from '@/components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section class="mt-20 md:mt-24">
    <SingOzCard
        layout="split"
        badge="Adults 18+ · No audition required"
        heading="Sing!OZ"
        headingLine="adult choir"
        cta="2026 program filled — waitlist for 2027"
    >
        <p class="m-0">
            For all those who have ever said "I wish there was something like
            this when I was young." Well, now there is. Harmony singing, vocal
            technique and a cracking repertoire — you don't need to be an
            accomplished singer, all you need is a love to sing.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0">
            Tuesdays 7–9pm, Lower Mitcham, school terms 2 & 3. $330 per
            ten-week term (Term 2 $360, includes t-shirt). Final concert
            Saturday 24 October at Norwood Concert Hall, backed by a live band.
        </p>
    </SingOzCard>
</Section>
